Unmodified Imagination PowerVR Rogue firmware for BVNC 22.102.54.38 and
36.56.104.183. Both files use the documented 1.1.OS@6976702 firmware interface.
The package retains the upstream license and firmware provenance record.

The operating-system driver selects the exact filename for its GPU profile.
Installing these files does not establish driver or rendering support.
